# eth-allowlist for the allocator: one Ethereum address per line, as reported
# by the tester's `allowlist_sign_module.identity` for
# eth-allowlist (`id`, lowercase 0x…). Lines starting
# with # and blank lines are ignored. Each address is granted ONE membership
# (it is the vector's nullifier). Saving this file re-`serve`s the running
# allocator within ~30 s — no restart needed.
